<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="kk">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Дәріхана — 5-нұсқа</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
           font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e6f7f1, #d3ecff); color: #12372a; }
    .card { background: #fff; padding: 40px 56px; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(18, 55, 42, .15); text-align: center; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 40px; color: #0f9d6b; }
    .cross { font-size: 48px; }
    table { margin: 24px auto 0; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 18px; }
    td { padding: 8px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e3eee9; text-align: left; }
    td:first-child { color: #5b7a6e; }
    code { background: #eef7f3; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="cross">✚</div>
    <h1>Дәріхана — 5-нұсқа</h1>
    <p>Бұл бетті Ansible Jinja2 template арқылы жасады</p>
    <table>
      <tr><td>Хост атауы</td><td><code>{{ ansible_hostname }}</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>IP-адрес</td><td><code>{{ ansible_default_ipv4.address }}</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>ОЖ</td><td><code>{{ ansible_distribution }} {{ ansible_distribution_version }}</code></td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
